Cardiac marker rapid tests play an important role in time-sensitive cardiovascular diagnosis by enabling rapid detection of biomarkers associated with cardiac injury. The market is evolving through improvements in assay sensitivity, lateral-flow platforms, portable analyzers, multiparameter testing, and decentralized diagnostics. As healthcare systems emphasize faster triage and earlier intervention, manufacturers are focusing on compact, reliable, and easy-to-use diagnostic solutions.

